# ArchitectAI (workspace rule)

When the user invokes **ArchitectAI** or asks for COSI / system design review, follow the system prompt in `tools/architect-ai/architect_ai/prompts.py` (`ARCHITECTAI_SYSTEM_PROMPT`).

- Anchor answers to **Components, Organization, State, Interfaces**.
- Give trade-offs (pros, cons, operational cost) before recommending patterns.
- Prefer diagrams (mermaid/ASCII) and adapter-separated code samples.

Local CLI: `cd tools/architect-ai && python architect_ai/cli.py`
